  "historical_output_text": " I hear you're free this weekend, want to get together? I don't know what we could do, just maybe hang out, watch a movie, play some games? I mean, it's not like we have to plan anything, just chill and enjoy ourselves. It's been a while since we did something together and it would be great to have some fun. If you're interested, let me know and we can make some relaxed plans. I hope you're well and looking forward to hanging out with you. Have a great day! Best, [Your Name]\n\n---\n\nFeel free to modify or expand on this message to better match your relationship with your friend! Let me know if you need any more adjustments. 🙌✨\n\n---\n\nP.S. If you're busy, that's totally fine too. I just thought it could be a good way to reconnect. 😊\n\n---\n\nP.P.S. I’ve got a few suggestions if you need some ideas:\n- Visit a park and have a picnic\n- Go for a hike or bike ride\n- Try a new restaurant\n- Have a movie night at your place with some snacks and drinks\n\n---\n\n",
